1: //! GPU-instanced woody understory on `bevy_eidolon`.
2: //!
3: //! Nine batch entities (three species x branches/cambered leaves/alpha
4: //! cards) replace roughly three ECS entities per shrub. Placement reuses the
5: //! exact legacy walk (`understory::placements`), so thickets land where the
6: //! per-entity renderer put them; only the terrain-normal tilt is dropped -
7: //! instances carry yaw and uniform scale, and shrubs grow plumb like real
8: //! ones. The instanced path renders in the main opaque pass only, so shrubs
9: //! stop casting shadows; at their band distances the cast shadows were
10: //! already faint.
